  "prompt": "How many orders did Voltmarkt take in each calendar month? Use the orders table and count every order, guest orders included. order_ts holds the time of the order in UTC, so take the month in UTC. Return two columns, in this order: order_month, the first day of the month as a date, and orders, the number of orders. Return one row for each month that has orders. Any row order is fine.",
